  nodeId: PV - Page 3
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "<b>Visuals</b>\r\nAction shot\u2014the hooded figure grabs the heavy
    porcelain vase and swings it with full force into Marcus's temple. Shards of
    porcelain scatter across the floor as Marcus collapses beside the desk, a dark
    pool of blood instantly spreading beneath his head.\r\n\r\n<b>Narrative/Audio</b>\r\n
    The fatal blow is delivered before Marcus hits the ground.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<i>No.
    of Panels: 4</i>\r\n<i>1. Hooded figure grabs the vase</i>\r\n<i>2. Marcus gets
    in front of desk</i>\r\n<i>3. Vase crashes into Marcus's temple</i>\r\n<i>4.
    Aftermath</i>\r\n\r"
